          <h3>Real-Time Live Photo Capture</h3>
          <p>
            On portals like <strong>exams.nta.ac.in</strong> (NEET UG / JEE Main) and <strong>natboard.edu.in</strong> (NEET PG), candidates are required to snap a live photo using their webcam or mobile browser. This serves as a live liveness verification during submission.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit-card">
