          <h3>Uploaded Scanned Photograph</h3>
          <p>
            Candidates must separately upload a high-clarity 3.5 × 4.5 cm scanned passport photo (10–200 KB JPG). This high-resolution photo is printed on your official <strong>e-Admit Card</strong>, verification roll, and counselling records.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit-card">
          <div class="benefit-icon">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
